{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"Loreak (Flowers)","La vida de Ane da un giro cuando semanalmente comienza a recibir de forma anónima un ramo de flores en su casa. Por su parte las vidas de Lourdes y Tere también se ven afectadas por unas misteriosas flores. Un desconocido deposita cada semana un ramo en memoria de alguien que fue importante en sus vidas. Esta es la historia de tres mujeres, tres vidas alteradas por la mera presencia de unas flores. Flores que harán brotar en ellas sentimientos que parecían olvidados… Pero al fin y al cabo, no son más que flores. (Ane's life turns around when, week after week, she receives a bunch of flowers at home. Always at the same time and always without a senders note.)",[4,5,6,7,8],"grief","extended family","rural","homosociality","women empowerment",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":16,"filmType":20,"directors":21,"genre":44,"media":46,"synopsis":49,"production":52,"characters":55,"roles":87,"awards":109,"tags":3},"Film","ES2014_009","es2014-009-loreak",{"native":14,"english":15},"Loreak","Flowers",{"type":17,"date":18,"year":19},"Theatrical release","2014-10-31",2014,"Fiction film",[22,39],{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":26,"gender":27,"nationality":28,"awards":29},"Jon Garaño","jon-garano",1974,0,"Male identifying","Spain",[30],{"film":31,"year":35,"award":36,"category":37,"result":38},{"slug":32,"title":33},"es2017-029-handia",{"native":34},"Handia",2017,"Premios Goya","Best Director","Nominated",{"id":40,"slug":41,"name":40,"birthYear":42,"deathYear":26,"gender":27,"nationality":28,"awards":43},"José Mari Goenaga","jose-mari-goenaga",1976,[],[45],"Drama",{"posterUrl":47,"trailerUrl":48},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3900206/mediaviewer/rm2339299840/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kTFRCIp_gks",{"native":50,"english":51},"La vida de Ane da un giro cuando semanalmente comienza a recibir de forma anónima un r